{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>He arose, went down to Joppa.</b> The Gaon [Saadia] says: for Tarshish is Tarsus. And Rabbi Moses [ibn Tibbon] says: that it is the city of Tunis in Africa." "<b>And paid its fare.</b> Not its entire fare, but only what he was obligated to pay for his portion."], :book :jonah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Jonah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=19&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:55.636009378Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}